post_install() {
    cat << EOF

Cronicle installed. Please review the configuration file at /opt/cronicle-git/conf/config.json. 
Next, if this is a master server, type: 'sudo /opt/cronicle-git/bin/control.sh setup' to init storage. 
Then, to start the service, type: 'sudo /opt/cronicle-git/bin/control.sh start'. 
For full docs, please visit: http://github.com/jhuckaby/Cronicle.

Enjoy!

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    cat << EOF

Cronicle upgraded. Please review the configuration file at /opt/cronicle-git/conf/config.json. 
For full docs, please visit: http://github.com/jhuckaby/Cronicle.

EOF
}